oper confirmed):**\n- **Profile selected tab resets on rotation.** With Pets selected, rotating to landscape switches the left menu back to Skills. I reproduced it twice. This is the rotation check from the \"Changed in this build\" item about the profile tab bar.\n\n**Filed, not reproduced by the developer:**\n- **Ent pet row overlap:** \"An ancient tree spirit that aids\" runs into \"+10% XP\". The developer could not reproduce it.\n- **Combat Level 80:** the Combat header, Profile header and Combat Level stat all show 80. With the stated levels I get 86 using the standard formula, which includes Prayer. The developer could not reproduce it. The game may use its own formula, so this may not be a bug.\n\n**Checked and consistent:**\n- Combat stats: ATK 89, STR 79 and DEF 75 match the gear and prestige (Attack +9, Iron Sword +10/+9, Bronze Boots +5).\n- Switching combat style to Ranged and back restores the same stats.\n- Skills tab: Attack, Strength, Defense and Hitpoints at 70 and Ranged/Magic at 40 show the expected XP values.\n- Bonuses list: Attack prestige +9 and Hitpoints +4 are shown, along with the Infinite Tower bonuses (+7% XP, +12% coins, +150 HP).\n- Gear tab: Bronze Pickaxe, Bronze Axe and Bronze Fishing Rod are equipped.\n- Dungeon sheet: the run-count +/− and the ×1/×5/×10/×20 chips stay in sync, and Cancel leaves no session running.\n- The Profile sidebar switches correctly between Inventory, Gear, Pets and Bonuses.\n\n**Not covered:**\n- **Pets list:** only 6 of the 30 pets are visible, and swiping does not scroll it. The other 24 are untested.\n- **Inventory list:** the lower items could not be scrolled into view either.\n- **Dungeon list:** Volcanic Depths and Dragon's Lair are below the fold and untested.\n- **Equipment changes:** I did not change equipment, so Unequip and Equip Best Gear were not exercised.\n\n**Other observations (not filed):**\n- Leaving the Profile screen and returning always shows Skills, so the selected tab is not kept across navigation. This may be intended.\n- In the Edit Character sheet, Gender is set to \"Other\" with the description \"male\", but the header reads \"Human • Male\". I couldn't tell whether the header is meant to derive from the free-text description.\n\nNext steps would be scrolling those lists, which the swipe tool here does not do. I can try other gestures or a different route to those screens if you want me to continue.", "ttft_ms": 1367, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 160643, "uuid": "392b4511-2d25-4ff8-8663-3a2535689d9d", "ttft_stream_ms": 1179, "time_to_request_ms": 416, "time_to_request_phases_ms": {"other": 3, "system_prompt": 8, "resume_other": 0, "process_user_input": 1, "input_attachments": 5, "input_hooks": 1, "conversation_append": 1, "tool_pool_refresh": 0, "init_message": 5, "init_frame_send": 2, "engine_pickup": 0, "loop_entry": 2, "message_prep": 1, "model_config_wait": 1, "autocompact": 1, "request_announcements": 3, "query_setup": 0, "model_gates": 372, "tool_schema_build": 3, "message_normalization": 1, "client_creation": 2, "request_build": 4}, "turn_start_resume_kind": "none", "process_turn_index": 0, "time_to_request_loop_lag_ms": 13, "time_to_request_cpu_ms": 149, "time_to_request_major_faults": 0, "input_attachments_detail": {"slowest_producer": "model", "slowest_producer_ms": 1, "cpu_ms": 6, "major_faults": 0, "setup_ms": 0, "prompt_producers_ms": 0, "ambient_start_ms": 1, "ambient_wait_ms": 0, "render_ms": 0, "producers": 43, "token_counts": 0}, "tool_schema_build_detail": {"betas_ms": 0, "waits_ms": 1, "placement_ms": 0, "render_ms": 1, "after_ms": 0, "other_ms": 1, "tools": 12, "new_schemas": 12}, "message_normalization_detail": {"before_ms": 0, "normalize_ms": 1, "images_ms": 0, "post_process_ms": 0, "after_ms": 0, "other_ms": 0, "messages": 9, "wire_messages": 2}, "request_build_detail": {"records_ms": 0, "system_ms": 1, "headers_ms": 0, "cache_break_record_ms": 1, "plans_ms": 0, "retry_setup_ms": 1, "sent_build_ms": 0, "record_att